etails-section"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container"><div data-w-id="cb3cc83f-c436-d02f-32ea-73b9fa776969" style="opacity:0" class="work-details-content-wrapper"><div class="work-details-section-title"><h2 class="work-details-heading">Nature&#x27;s Whisper</h2><div class="work-details-info"><div class="work-category"><p class="work-category-default-text">YEAR</p><p class="work-category-text">2022</p></div><div class="work-category"><p class="work-category-default-text">CATEGORY</p><p class="work-category-text">Promotional</p></div><div class="work-category"><p class="work-category-default-text">CLIENT</p><p class="work-category-text">Danton Jones</p></div></div></div><div class="work-vidro-wrap"><div style="padding-top:56.20608899297424%" class="work-video w-video w-embed"><iframe class="embedly-embed" src="//cdn.embedly.com/widgets/media.html?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2Fwatch%3Fv%3D88F3eTsV4cI&type=text%2Fhtml&schema=google&display_name=YouTube&src=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2Fembed%2F88F3eTsV4cI" width="854" height="480" scrolling="no" title="YouTube embed" frameborder="0" allow="autoplay; fullscreen; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture;" allowfullscreen="true"></iframe></div></div><div class="work-details-content-wrapper-02"><div class="work-details-content-wrap"><p class="body-text-16">[OVERVOEW]</p><div class="work-details-content w-richtext"><h5>A sweeping aerial shot begins at dawn, revealing Brooklyn&#x27;s iconic brownstones bathed in soft morning light. The camera slowly rises, unveiling the dense urban landscape.</h5><p>‍</p><p>As it pans, the Manhattan skyline emerges on the horizon, its skyscrapers reflecting the golden sunrise. The East River cuts through the frame, with the Brooklyn Bridge in view. Traffic begins to flow, and the city awakens. The shot ends with a focus on a local coffee shop, where early risers start their day, connecting the grand cityscape to intimate street-level life.</p></div><div><a href="/conta